{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/400842-recruitment-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth","id":400842,"title":"[Recruitment][Exalted 2.5] The Emerald Labyrinth","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-10T14:24:17-08:00","id":400842,"title":"[Recruitment][Exalted 2.5] The Emerald Labyrinth","content":"Hello all, I'm recruiting for a new play by post game of Exalted 2.5 in order to scratch that STing itch until 3rd edition comes out.<br /> <br /> Ideal group size: 4-6<br /> <br /> Banned Exalt Types: I'd be leery of Infernals or Abyssals, but if you have a good back-story, we could probably work soemthing out. I'd prefer no Alchemicals, too, for obvious reasons.<br /> <br /> Premise: In the far North, there exists an Emerald unlike any other. Larger and more fertile than the others, this secluded valley doesn't get attacked by ravagers, as the entire valley is taken up by gigantic forests that are home to dangerous flora and fauna. However, in spite of this, the promises of treasures and the valuable commodities that can be gained from the animals and plants means that many adventurers and seekers of wealth flock there. Today, Lastchance, the paltry Haslan trading town at the edge of this terrible forest, has become a beacon for those seeking to test their mettle throughout the North. What will you find when you delve its depths?<br /> <br /> Thanks for reading, and I look forward to seeing your characters!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 02-10-2015, 06:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date: