yxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T12:31:27-08:00","id":411879,"title":"","content":"To be honest, I'm not the best at it either.<br /> <br /> The best I've come up with (other than Orca) in terms of flowery names are &quot;Midnight Fox&quot; and &quot;Sesus Kalak, the Ascending Phoenix/The Dragon of the Sun&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T20:08:15-08:00","id":412367,"title":"","content":"Okay, I am well past the point where I promised that I would have a character sheet available. I apologize for this, but I am making progress. It appears that I have to check many different books to make sure I have all my charms, spells, and thaumaturgy selected correctly. It is a much more involved task than getting everything together for the Solar I play in Forging A Nation. Two books for that and Five for this. Plus, that Solar concept was one I had been sitting on and planning for years. This one I had the idea for, but never really looked at what I would need to do to make it happen. Meh, worst case is you guys start and then I join later.<br /> <br /> The good news is that I am very close to being done. I just need to get my intimacies and contacts selected and I can have something finalized, typed up, and shared here.<br /> <br /> Tell me what you guys think of this name. (It is a male name from Romania, I swear.) Marian, the Prodigal of Ashen Remorse. It is an Abyssal name, so it has to be filled with all kinds of angst.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-19T21:38:50-08:00","id":412419,"title":"","content":"Would it safe to say that most (if not all of us) are heading to Last Chance on the <i>Dancing Pelican</i>?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T04:24:26-08:00","id":412628,"title":"","content":"That works for me. My character could have recently acquired a business in Last Chance or something. Maybe a tea house or something so that we have a base of operations on ground. I better ask the st about it.<br /> <br /> Also, do we know what the other characters are? It will save a lot of introduction time if everyone is at least aware that we are exalted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T08:44:22-08:00","id":412843,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/400842-recruitment-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=410921#post410921\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hate coming up with character names. Especially the &quot;Flowery words of awesome&quot; names Exalted has.</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually find the descriptive name-titles most Exalted have to be very liberating. As opposed to Dirk the Sword Fighter in DnD, you have Bright Flashing Steel, Sword Saint and all-round badass fightin' man. It gives you an ability to describe what you want your character to be in addition to their other nuances and fiddly bits, like abilities and charms and what have you.<br /> <br /> @Exthalion: Roll of Glorious Divinity II, page 94, part of the header &quot;The Undead Condition,&quot; where they describe ghosts' corpus not only as their body, but also a means of stratifying their place in Undead society, where only the incredibly wealthy even have the means to buy new clothes, and only the very old or insane even attempt to alter their corpus to trick others. It's actually pretty interesting, and also why I concluded that bit about &quot;Clothes are wealth in the Underworld.&quot;<br /> <br /> @Belkra: It's fine. I understand how it is for a Sorcerer/Necromancer, and when I finally got my hands on MoEP: Abyssals, I was sorely disappointed by the sheer lack of Necromancy in the book; something that I hope 3e fixes, but I have a feeling they won't, if only because it means another book they can print.<br /> <br /> @Magnusar: The submodule is fine. I figure if no one raised any objections at this point, then you can go ahead and purchase it.<br /> <br /> @Revenge of the TV Head: How is it going for you with your character? I have't heard from you in a while.<br /> <br /> So, barring TV and Belkra, I think everyone is ready. When would you all like me to start this thing? This weekend? Sometime next week?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T09:22:42-08:00","id":412867,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/400842-recruitment-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=412843#post412843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I actually find the descriptive name-titles most Exalted have to be very liberating. As opposed to Dirk the Sword Fighter in DnD, you have Bright Flashing Steel, Sword Saint and all-round badass fightin' man. It gives you an ability to describe what you want your character to be in addition to their other nuances and fiddly bits, like abilities and charms and what have you.</div> </div> </div> </div>I love the Exalted character names... that other people choose. I just can't come up with anything cool and poetic sounding for my characters! I am trying to come up with a pen name for my Twilight for when she starts up her illicit First Age/Old Realm translation and publishing house.<br /> <br /> Sweeping River of Wisdom? Everflowing Ink Shrouded in Twilight? Totally Not a Solar Trying to Distribute First Age Knowledge?<br /> <br /> Ugh. I rather just look up some characteristic on baby names website and choose an cool sounding name. It's lame and lazy, but it gets the job done. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T10:45:53-08:00","id":412936,"title":"","content":"I'd be ok with starting it this weekend","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T11:03:02-08:00","id":412942,"title":"","content":"I am also cool with this weekend.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T11:07:37-08:00","id":412946,"title":"","content":"I can start this weekend as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T11:16:49-08:00","id":412954,"title":"","content":"I'm nearly ready. The week's been much, much busier than I'd thought it would be and I haven't had a chance to finish my Charms and bio. Hoping to get it done by tomorrow night actually, provided that some other disaster doesn't strike.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T12:39:10-08:00","id":413033,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/400842-recruitment-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=412867#post412867\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I love the Exalted character names... that other people choose. I just can't come up with anything cool and poetic sounding for my characters! I am trying to come up with a pen name for my Twilight for when she starts up her illicit First Age/Old Realm translation and publishing house.<br /> <br /> Sweeping River of Wisdom? Everflowing Ink Shrouded in Twilight? Totally Not a Solar Trying to Distribute First Age Knowledge?<br /> <br /> Ugh. I rather just look up some characteristic on baby names website and choose an cool sounding name. It's lame and lazy, but it gets the job done. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I actually like those two. They're descriptive and evocative of the concept you laid out. If it helps, I like to think of my character with a shorter single word name and go from there. For instance, a slayer I had whose entire life was a series of terrible unforeseen events, I named Sky so she could fly off from the shackles of her earlier humiliations, her full name being Triumphant Sky.<br /> <br /> Alternatively, you could be like my GM Noodle and use any of the available Exalted name generators and work from there. His last character being, initially, Starmetal Blade, a fast-talking cocky Chosen of Journeys swordsmen. However, his given shortened name being Blade and being described as akin to Kirito from Sword Art Online made everyone assume that the guy was actually a deep-voiced spazz who hunted vampires. Thus, he became Blade Edgemaster, cocky undead killer who usually also got his shit kicked in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T12:49:02-08:00","id":413042,"title":"","content":"Hmmm... Maybe it's more of a &quot;I think they sound stupid because I made them up&quot; thing then.<br /> <br /> I think I am going to go with <b>Everflowing Ink Shrouded in Wisdom</b>. A combination of the two that doesn't scream &quot;I'm a Solar!&quot; And though my character still goes by her birth name, if she does start using some flowery name, she could go by &quot;Ink&quot;.<br /> <br /> Thanks for your words of encouragement. Now to stop derailing your thread and get back to talking about the Emerald Labyrinth. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-20-2015, 03:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T14:27:42-08:00","id":413121,"title":"","content":"This weekend's okay for me. Also-apparently this is where everything is going on! I wondered why the OOC thread was so quiet.<br /> <br /> If some of you want to show up in town on Nergui's airship, that's fine. That said, it's probably a journey of a few weeks in relatively close quarters, so if we're arriving that way we'll have gotten to know each other a bit ahead of time.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T15:05:04-08:00","id":413201,"title":"","content":"Wise Old Guru, did you decide who you wanted as a Solar mate? Or not have a solar mate at all?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-20-2015, 07:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T08:08:31-08:00","id":414037,"title":"","content":"I just notice that there is a good oportunity for friendship between our characters dreamking along with yours too wonderandawe. Orca is on the path to become a savant just like Unrestrained Lover and Lin is here to make money which is funny because Unrestrained Iover wants to trade technologies and his expertise with the Hastlani league and having a partner that knows how to trade is priceless. The benefits and profits could be enormous, you want to enter the trade of magitech and other technologies that even the guild doesn't have wonderandawe ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T09:07:17-08:00","id":414064,"title":"","content":"That might work. Your character will need someone who will keep others from taking advantage of him. Two strangers in a strange icy land! <br /> <br /> Though, Zarah's goal is a bit more than making money. Making money is easy. Making something that will last lifetimes is a greater challenge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T09:38:36-08:00","id":414093,"title":"","content":"In terms of Solar Mates...I didn't take any dots in the Bond, and I don't really have strong ideas for a Past Life for Nergui, so I'll just leave things in the hands of Destiny.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T11:41:45-08:00","id":414227,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/400842-recruitment-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=414093#post414093\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In terms of Solar Mates...I didn't take any dots in the Bond, and I don't really have strong ideas for a Past Life for Nergui, so I'll just leave things in the hands of Destiny.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, you can still have a Solar Mate, right? You just can't get the bonuses for having it as a background.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T13:09:22-08:00","id":414337,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dreamking89</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/400842-recruitment-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=414227#post414227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, you can still have a Solar Mate, right? You just can't get the bonuses for having it as a background.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is correct. The bond background just makes your better able to protect/work for them and less resistant to what they want. If we are being anything but apologists for it, it makes you into a better slave.<br /> <br /> The base is just that IF you ever run into them you get an intimacy of some sort that doesn't go away. (though it can change) So they will always be important to you in some way, though that way may be your desire to kill them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T13:33:14-08:00","id":414397,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/400842-recruitment-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=414093#post414093\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In terms of Solar Mates...I didn't take any dots in the Bond, and I don't really have strong ideas for a Past Life for Nergui, so I'll just leave things in the hands of Destiny.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ha! I didn't even think about a Past Life for Zarah. What is going on in the present and the future is more important than anything that might have happened thousands of years ago. <br /> <br /> No worries about the Solar Mate thing. If Zarah and the Unrestrained Lover end up being business partners then my character has a connection with someone in the group. Also, there might be some conflict between Zarah and Nergui. You did mention that your character might want to exploit the poor lost Alchemical. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T13:53:31-08:00","id":414411,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/400842-recruitment-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=414397#post414397\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Ha! I didn't even think about a Past Life for Zarah. What is going on in the present and the future is more important than anything that might have happened thousands of years ago.<br /> <br /> No worries about the Solar Mate thing. If Zarah and the Unrestrained Lover end up being business partners then my character has a connection with someone in the group. Also, there might be some conflict between Zarah and Nergui. You did mention that your character might want to exploit the poor lost Alchemical. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>By exploit... do you mean chain to the dark side of the moon and mine for magical materials and techno-sorcerous miracles? Because I am certain we could arrange that. (Because this is an entirely original idea and is not taken from Shards of the Exalted Dream)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T14:10:51-08:00","id":414429,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/400842-recruitment-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=414411#post414411\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> By exploit... do you mean chain to the dark side of the moon and mine for magical materials and techno-sorcerous miracles? Because I am certain we could arrange that. (Because this is an entirely original idea and is not taken from Shards of the Exalted Dream)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah..... Why do we keep your character around again? :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T14:51:09-08:00","id":414458,"title":"","content":"Random question: Would a Intimacy towards knowledge be ok? Like, Orca would be totally against destroying First Age artifacts/manses or burning down a library or something like that?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T15:12:45-08:00","id":414487,"title":"","content":"You can have intimacies for/against ideas and places.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T15:31:20-08:00","id":414500,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I've been trying to think of more Intimacies for Orca. I think I'll go with &quot;Preservation of Knowledge&quot; for one, which makes a grand total of two. I'll try to think of a few more, then post an updated character sheet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T16:39:49-08:00","id":414603,"title":"","content":"You can have intimacies for dead relatives too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T07:40:22-08:00","id":415131,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/400842-recruitment-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=414064#post414064\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That might work. Your character will need someone who will keep others from taking advantage of him. Two strangers in a strange icy land!<br /> <br /> Though, Zarah's goal is a bit more than making money. Making money is easy. Making something that will last lifetimes is a greater challenge.</div> </div> </div> </div>True, do you have ideas on how they encountered each other and what kind of relationship they have ? I was thinking that they could have met a few days before he proposed his services to the league and you could have negotiated the deal what do you think ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T08:20:29-08:00","id":415150,"title":"","content":"That might work. Zarah has been in the North for a couple of months. I think your character has been around for the same time.<br /> <br /> Perhaps Zarah over hears your character trying to set up a meeting with someone in the League to propose your services. However, it is quiet obvious that you are unfamiliar with even the basic forms of protocol. Though observation and use of the Courtier's Eye Technique, Zarah realizes that you are a man (?) of great skill and you are utterly alone in the North like she is. Thus she will introduce herself and offer to advise you in your dealings with the Haslanti League.<br /> <br /> If that goes well, she will probably try to get more information out of you about where you are from. If it is obvious that you have no clue about the Immaculate Order (or well anything in creation), she will reveal herself as a Solar. She has to trust someone and who better than an individual who is in a more extreme version of the situation she is in. She will give you a primer on how to avoid being hunted down as an Anathema (because the Wyld Hunt will probably just lump you into Anathema grouping) and is patient enough to answer any questions you have about Creation.<br /> <br /> If we go with this, I might change my Guild contacts to Haslanti League contacts. Instead of working on building Guild contacts, she would be working on building Haslanti League contacts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-22-2015, 11:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T09:13:34-08:00","id":415241,"title":"","content":"Also, I was thinking maybe instead of a tea house, Zarah can start up an import export business. There is probably a lot of interesting and valuable items coming out of the Emerald Labyrinth .<br /> <br /> If we play our cards right, we can set ourselves up as the first buyers that explorers go to sell their stuff. Our crafters will get a source of materials and have a way to bring in anything the area can't provide.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-22-2015, 12:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T09:42:32-08:00","id":415328,"title":"","content":"That works just fine for me and I think the import export business is a great idea, getting our hands on magical material and exotic ingredient might be difficult without someone who has the contact for getting it.<br /> <br /> My characters will try to build a powerful war forge manse (probably something close to a factory cathedral) and use it to provide weapons and ships to the other players and the league. This require research and effort like Dietaku said but it could be a boon for everyone in the game and since I am not the only crafter in the team Dreamking89's character will surely want a piece of that action, after all there is a Technological maniac Deathlord in the region we need to even the odds a bit don't you think ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 02-22-2015, 12:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T09:50:34-08:00","id":415338,"title":"","content":"To be honest, Zarah isn't really a Tea House Eclipse anyways. I see her as having a back office in some large warehouse, working on how to funnel merchandise in and out of Last Chance (and eventually the North). <br /> <br /> I might keep the Guild contacts. They have more reach than the Haslanti League (thus more materials). Not that will stop you from allying with them, Magnusar.<br /> <br /> Also, I would like to note that Zarah isn't above bending a few laws to get what she wants. She isn't murdering anyone or anything. (Well, not any more. Blessed Isle is a rough place for a Solar to hide.) Will that bother your character?<br /> <br /> Also, did DreamingKing89 want in on the plan? Anyone else?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-22-2015, 12:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T10:21:42-08:00","id":415353,"title":"","content":"My plan was for Orca to have literally been stepping off the airship when we started. But it might be a good idea to have established himself a bit first. His big thing upon arriving is going to be exploring.the vast unknown that is the Emerald Labyrinth (probably starting with that Ice Tower that's so close to Last Chance). I suppose that can work with an import export business.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T12:55:43-08:00","id":415569,"title":"","content":"We will be totally still stepping off the airship where we are playing. I'm still planning on keeping the &quot;Zarah bought a building. Who knows what condition it is in?&quot; Just it will be a warehouse instead of a tea house.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T13:04:05-08:00","id":415581,"title":"","content":"Oh! Then she kinda 'bought the warehouse ahead' so to speak? Sounds good to me.<br /> <br /> <br /> I'm assuming we all met on the boat ride over to Last Chance and somehow discovered we were all Exalted? Or do some of you know each other from beforehand and I missed something?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T13:25:37-08:00","id":415600,"title":"","content":"My character is not exactly subtle about is alchemical nature you just need to look at him to notice he is not normal. Oh and dont worry about the condition of zara's warehouse once Unrestrained Lover is done with it, it will be better than new.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 02-22-2015, 04:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T13:33:11-08:00","id":415602,"title":"","content":"I have told the Unrestrained Lover beforehand. He probably could have told you about Zarah, when he learned that Orca were a savant. Which might annoy Zarah, until she finds out Orca is a Solar also. Which will lead to yet another conversation about &quot;there are dangerous people who hunt us down so we are trying to keep the whole Solar thing quiet&quot;.<br /> <br /> It would be funny if the Unrestrained Lover ends up outing all the Anathema (and other exalts) on the air ship before we land. Well, it would be funny to me out of character. Maybe not to everyone else.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T17:20:19-08:00","id":415897,"title":"","content":"Honestly, I don't feel like Orca would be too secretive about being anathema either. I mean, he literally took his Second Breath in front of a western Wyld Hunt, so he pretty much was Most Wanted from day one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T18:13:57-08:00","id":415949,"title":"","content":"Twenty-Fifth Merciful is known to Joachim and half of the North, by description at least. He goes around in disguise due to a funny misunderstanding about a war he, allegedly, started.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-22T18:39:17-08:00","id":415962,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dreamking89</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/400842-recruitment-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=415897#post415897\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly, I don't feel like Orca would be too secretive about being anathema either. I mean, he literally took his Second Breath in front of a western Wyld Hunt, so he pretty much was Most Wanted from day one.</div> </div> </div> </div>Zarah smacks her forehead. &quot;That would have been good information to share before we entered into a sanctified business contract!&quot; <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar