userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T19:52:52-08:00","id":417098,"title":"","content":"I hit another snag with my life getting in the way of my gaming. I had a car die so I am putting in time trying to make that not suck so much. Have to get rid of that one, (Where did I put that title?) shop around for a new one, and try to make sure transportation needs are met with half as many cars (grabbing groceries after work, yeah!).<br /> <br /> Also, I was recording the character on an interactive sheet that is absolutely awesome. However, I noticed no areas on it for intimacies or thaumaturgy.<br /> <br /> I want a Manse with the Life Draining Stone. At least I think that is what it is called. It's a level one Abyssal stone from Oadenal's Codex. I also forget the exact effect just yet. I just know I want a stone to put in my Soulsteel Hearthstone Amulet, and it was a relatively cheap way to do that. I also have Soulsteel Hearthstone Bracers, cause reasons. (I don't have a stone to put in that one, but meh.) I also need to see if I can find stats for an artifact staff, preferably Soulsteel. (Not to be confused with &quot;Soul Steal!&quot;)<br /> <br /> Short story, long; I just need to sit down and put the finishing touches on this guy and type of a sheet. I literally just need intimacies, and to calculate DVs. All the Charms, BPs, Attributes, Abilities, Spells, Thaumaturgy and all that jazz are good to go. Excited about playing a Necromancer that is pretty freakin' knowledgeable about religion in addition to wanting to destroy all things Underworld.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-