":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-24T06:42:21-08:00","id":417482,"title":"","content":"That link goes to your c drive. We don't have access to that. You will have to upload the file somewhere on the internet to share it.<br /> <br /> <br /> Go to <b>Drive.Google.com</b> and set up a google drive.<br /> <br /> Once you have a google drive, you should see a big orange button on the left side called <b>New</b> Click on that and a menu will appear. Select <b>File Upload</b> from the Menu.<br /> <br /> In the Open Dialogue box, navigate to where you file is located on your computer. An file upload popup will appear on the bottom left corner of your browser window. It will let you know when the file is done uploading.<br /> <br /> In the list of files on google drive, find your file and right click it. Select the <b>Share</b> option on the menu. <br /> <br /> On the popup box, click the <b>Get Sharable Link</b> link. Copy the Web Address it gives you and paste it into the Onyx Path forum post.<br /> <br /> <br /> Let me know if you have any questions! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":